hysics in Suika!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knew planets could be so bouncy? Use the Plutos and Moons to take control of your stack and navigate space. Master the games Physics to combine the planets until you make a big Sun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686980/extras/b60143937582da363539103c0112132d.avif?t=1771710355\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686980/extras/c56df7140d4a4ee458453ee66833061a.poster.avif?t=1771710355\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686980/extras/c56df7140d4a4ee458453ee66833061a.webm?t=1771710355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686980/extras/c56df7140d4a4ee458453ee66833061a.mp4?t=1771710355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Go Beyond the Sun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flex your skills by merging two suns and creating a black hole that wipes out all other planets on the board. Score big, and get more space to pile up planets for even higher scores! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["design.reject"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686980/header.jpg?t=1771710355","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2686980/630768/bb9d472b5467c7f19a49205e4ec0234892547d51/1750943258/dash_av1.mpd?t=1701475169","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstat